From a9192af7ab6b349e8870cea28c8914a0343c5827 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Season Tempo Build <claude@seasontempo.local>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 18:56:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] Finance and Performance integrity

Finance
  Tournament committed cost used a float reduce while Finance worked in cents;
  the two could disagree by a penny. One cents-safe path now.
  A deleted player leaves the obligation detached by design, so the money
  survives, but it displayed with no name. The stored name is the fallback.

Performance
  The W/L/T record read every game in the organization with a comment claiming
  RLS supplied the scope. RLS scopes by organization, not season. It did not
  show because every organization has games in one season so far; the first
  team to start a second season would have seen last season's wins.
  QAB reason label reads 'Situational success'. Display only: the stored key
  situation_success is what the constraint and every recorded plate appearance
  use.
